# graft's local graph cache — regenerable, not committed (run `graft build`).
graft/

# Downloaded upstream graphics packages (~200 MB: the GR tarball and its
# extraction). Re-fetchable from the URLs in docs/plotting-and-units-plan.md.
# Note media/plotly.min.js is NOT here — that one ships inside the extension.
vendor/
# ...except the vendored @blade-lang/ide-protocol tarball itself (npm pack
# output of ../Blade/protocol, refreshed by `npm run vendor:protocol`) — that
# one IS committed, since it's this extension's only runtime dependency and
# there is no npm registry involved.
!vendor/blade-lang-ide-protocol-*.tgz
